							<BrandIcon Name="info" Size="0.75em" />
						Idempotence
					</h3>

					<p class="page-hero__sub">
						An already-static version has no leading prefix, so rule 2 passes it through
						- pinning a pinned file is a no-op rewrite: <code>P(P(c)) = P(c)</code>.
					</p>
