						Wildcard behavior
					</h3>

					<p class="page-hero__sub">
						Documented edge decision: <code>"^1.*"</code> IS stripped to
						<code>"1.*"</code> - the law strips the notation (the prefix) and leaves the
						content untouched; protect wildcards with the keep-list if you need them
						preserved.
					</p>
