			<p class="page-hero__sub" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md)">
				<strong>Load order is not list order.</strong> The pinner can activate before the
				governor at boot - the registration order is not controlled by the bundles-list
				order. Never rely on it for step ordering: the sequential fold and the
				fresh-version writes make the order irrelevant, and each plugin's ledger answers
				for its own activation.
			</p>
			<p class="page-hero__sub">
				<strong>The composition holds under either order.</strong> A fully pinned manifest
				leaves the governor's update stage nothing to do, and the chain pass may still
				re-canonicalize chain pins - the two passes are idempotent under either
				activation sequence.
			</p>
